<title>USA: Crown American sees FY 1997 FFO lower.</title>
<headline>Crown American sees FY 1997 FFO lower.</headline>
<dateline>JOHNSTOWN, Pa. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crown American Realty Trust said Thursday it expects funds from operations in 1997 to be about 5 percent lower than in 1996 primarily due to higher interest costs and lower gain on outparcel land sales.</p>
<p>For the full year 1997, the company said it expects total revenues and earnings before interest, depreciation and amortization to be relatively flat compared to 1996.</p>
